{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/710047-what-would-the-infestation-atavism-look-like-on-non-namtaru","id":710047,"title":"What would the Infestation Atavism look like on non-Namtaru?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-10-19T23:07:26-07:00","id":710047,"title":"What would the Infestation Atavism look like on non-Namtaru?","content":"I am unsure, but here are my ideas.<br /> <br /> Anakim: viscous, boiling blood of varying color, covered in huge bone splinters and bone-crushing jaws.<br /> <br /> Eshmaki: amorphous clouds of smoke and shadow. Those caught within cannot tell if they are being stabbed, bitten or clawed.<br /> <br /> Makara: leeches, eels, crustaceans and piranhas.<br /> <br /> Ugallu: a murder of crows or other birds of prey, or perhaps bats.<br /> <br /> What about other Atavisms that are very tied to the imagery of a specific Family? An Anakim with Monster From The Deep might have arms like tree trunks and covered in long bone blades. A Makara with Wings Of The Raptor might look like a jellyfish, with inflatable fleshy sacs of gas that allow flight.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 10-27-2015, 08:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-20T19:05:13-07:00","id":711594,"title":"","content":"I imagine even for Namtaru that the insect thing is just the most common way it tends to appear. I like the idea of Medusa having Infestation while being made of snakes.<br /> <br /> Your other re-imaginings are fun.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Revlid wrote:<br /> Yes, hollowing out your humanity to become an utterly utilitarian asura is the exact suggestion I would expect from you, Aiden.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/168-aiden","name":"Aiden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-20T19:28:44-07:00","id":711614,"title":"","content":"Too bad Dragonfire is specifically described as Fire, as I would love to hose down my Acid-Rainer's enemies with nematocysts, or actual acid.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-21T08:49:28-07:00","id":712531,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hexmeister Vic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/710047-what-would-the-infestation-atavism-look-like-on-non-namtaru?p=711614#post711614\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Too bad Dragonfire is specifically described as Fire, as I would love to hose down my Acid-Rainer's enemies with nematocysts, or actual acid.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, It's described as fire, but why not change that if it works for you. Mechanically it shouldn't be much different. So why not just change the visual aspect of it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5610-aslan751","name":"aslan751","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5610_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-21T09:17:03-07:00","id":712564,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>aslan751</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/710047-what-would-the-infestation-atavism-look-like-on-non-namtaru?p=712531#post712531\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, It's described as fire, but why not change that if it works for you. Mechanically it shouldn't be much different. So why not just change the visual aspect of it?</div> </div> </div> </div>In fact, wasn't there a sidebar as well that said you could reflavour and change the damage types to get exactly what you wanted?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size