iew Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, It's described as fire, but why not change that if it works for you. Mechanically it shouldn't be much different. So why not just change the visual aspect of it?</div> </div> </div> </div>The only issue I have is crossover interactions: I can heal Prometheans with Storm-Lashed, and Dragonfire is an ace against Kindred and Created, but other damage types are a little nerfed, as most can fast heal out of them, and the above 2 count them as Bashing IIRC. That's the main gripe I have with Atavisms and Lair Traits, that the damage the cause isn't generally considered magical.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-21T18:54:29-07:00","id":713427,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hexmeister Vic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/710047-what-would-the-infestation-atavism-look-like-on-non-namtaru?p=712706#post712706\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The only issue I have is crossover interactions: I can heal Prometheans with Storm-Lashed, and Dragonfire is an ace against Kindred and Created, but other damage types are a little nerfed, as most can fast heal out of them, and the above 2 count them as Bashing IIRC. That's the main gripe I have with Atavisms and Lair Traits, that the damage the cause isn't generally considered magical.</div> </div> </div> </div>It still does Aggravated if you spend Satiety, regardless of who you're using it on.<br /> <br /> More Infestation types!<br /> <br /> A dragon with metallic scales collapsing into a shower of coins that roll of their own accord.<br /> Turning into a living liquid or ooze.<br /> Rats probably represent the upper limit on the size of things you can become.<br /> <br /> <br /> Monster From the Deep, despite its name, is incredibly easy to fluff for anything large; just make a sweeping attack with arms, tail, wings, etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1419,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","user":"WarDragon","date":". 10-21-2015, 09:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-21T20:33:42-07:00","id":713609,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WarDragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/710047-what-would-the-infestation-atavism-look-like-on-non-namtaru?p=713427#post713427\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It still does Aggravated if you spend Satiety, regardless of who you're using it on.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Kindred Endurance and Atavism rules may disagree with you on that, but that's for a different thread.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> More Infestation types!<br /> <br /> A dragon with metallic scales collapsing into a shower of coins that roll of their own accord.<br /> Turning into a living liquid or ooze.<br /> Rats probably represent the upper limit on the size of things you can become. </div> </div> </div>A cloud of Black Fungus spores, just to play the System Mastery card, and look like the foil from Ghost Rider 2.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Monster From the Deep, despite its name, is incredibly easy to fluff for anything large; just make a sweeping attack with arms, tail, wings, etc. </div> </div> </div>Or tentacles, if you went for something from DnD.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-01T20:58:07-08:00","id":748325,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WarDragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/710047-what-would-the-infestation-atavism-look-like-on-non-namtaru?p=713427#post713427\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A dragon with metallic scales collapsing into a shower of coins that roll of their own accord.</div> </div> </div> </div> I imagine a Horror with a metallic hide usually turns into a cloud of crude, levitating knives made of the same metal. Alternatively, a Horror that hoards precious metals and gems (or just uses them temporarily to lure prey) might turn into a swarm of crushing geodes, spiky crystals or molten gold.<br /> <br /> Dragonfire should deal aggravated damage to vampires, even without Satiety Expenditure. The exception is if the vampire has Resilience, which explicitly downgrades damage from fire into lethal, and then healed with Vitae. I'd say that Satiety Expenditure would bypass the Resilience if the Beast's Lair exceeds the vampire's Blood Potency.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 11-02-2015, 12:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T11:27:30-07:00","id":988311,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GibberingEloquence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/710047-what-would-the-infestation-atavism-look-like-on-non-namtaru?p=748325#post748325\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I imagine a Horror with a metallic hide usually turns into a cloud of crude, levitating knives made of the same metal. Alternatively, a Horror that hoards precious metals and gems (or just uses them temporarily to lure prey) might turn into a swarm of crushing geodes, spiky crystals or molten gold.</div> </div> </div> </div>Metal Golem Horror's Infestation: I imagine it T-1000 style, quicksilvery moving liquid.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}